msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Shiro. Taichi told me all about what's been going on.\r\n"
"Has the teacher's son really been bullying you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Why didn't you tell me sooner?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Please, Shiro. I need you to talk to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "But Yoshinori... He said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"He said his dad plays golf with Akasaka-sensei from the\r\n"
"city council."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"That he'd get them to shut Morning Glory down if I tattled\r\n"
"on him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Guess the apple doesn't fall far from the tree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "It's okay, Shiro. Don't cry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I'm not crying! I'm just... frustrated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Yoshinori only picks on kids when he knows they're not\r\n"
"gonna fight back... It's not right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Don't worry, Morning Glory's not going anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"So the next time he tries to mess with you, I want you to\r\n"
"stand up for yourself. You hear me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "...Mhm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"(I figured out why Shiro's so down... but that's not enough.\r\n"
"I've gotta fix this somehow.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Shiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "I want you to tell me what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "You can trust me, Shiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"Please. All I want is for you to be happy. You and everyone\r\n"
"else here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"I'm not gonna just stand around doing nothing when you're\r\n"
"so clearly in need of help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Come on, just tell me what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "...Is someone bullying you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "All right. I'll go have a talk with your school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "You can't!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Why not? I already spoke to your teacher, but he wasn't\r\n"
"a whole lot of help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Shiro..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "You sure you're feeling all right, Shiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "I said I'm fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "You don't seem fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Ugh, why don't you listen!? Just leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "Hey there, Shiro. Everything okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "...I'm fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"You don't look fine. Everyone else is having fun outside,\r\n"
"but you're sitting in here all by yourself. Are you sure\r\n"
"you're okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Just leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Does your stomach hurt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Not really..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Did something happen at school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "Does this have to do with a girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "...What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Well, you're at the age that boys start⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "That's not it! Just leave me alone, okay!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "(Guess I was wrong.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"(Hm, doesn't look like he wants to talk. Maybe the other\r\n"
"kids would know something.)"
msgstr ""

